{
  "id": "c239",
  "name": "1.01 Group 1 Loans",
  "text": "Group 1 Loans: Those Mortgage Loans identified on the Mortgage Loan Schedule as Group 1 Loans."
},
{
  "id": "c240",
  "name": "1.01 Group 1 Principal Distribution Amount",
  "text": "Group 1 Principal Distribution Amount: With respect to each Distribution Date, the product of (i) the Principal Distribution Amount and (ii) a fraction, the numerator of which is the Principal Remittance Amount for Loan Group 1 for that Distribution Date and the denominator of which is the aggregate Principal Remittance Amount for all of the Loan Groups for that Distribution Date."
},
{
  "id": "c241",
  "name": "1.01 Group 1 Senior Principal Distribution Amount",
  "text": "Group 1 Senior Principal Distribution Amount: With respect to each Distribution Date, the product of (i) the Senior Principal Distribution Amount and (ii) a fraction, the numerator of which is the Principal Remittance 24 of 177 9/28/2010 12:22 PM Exhibit 4.1 http://www.secinfo.com/$/SEC/Filing.asp?H=13f21.v1Hs.d&OS=W Amount for Loan Group 1 for that Distribution Date and the denominator of which is the aggregate Principal Remittance Amount for all of the Loan Groups for that Distribution Date."
},
{
  "id": "c242",
  "name": "1.01 Group 1 XW Amount",
  "text": "Group 1 XW Amount: With respect to each Distribution Date, an amount equal to (i) the Current Interest for the Class XW Certificates for that Distribution Date multiplied by (ii) the sum of the Class Principal Balances of the Group 1 Certificates divided by the Class XW Notional Amount, in each case, as of immediately prior to that Distribution Date."
},
{
  "id": "c243",
  "name": "1.01 Group 2 Certificates",
