  "text": "Group 2 Loans: Those Mortgage Loans identified on the Mortgage Loan Schedule as Group 2 Loans."
},
{
  "id": "c245",
  "name": "1.01 Group 2 Principal Distribution Amount",
  "text": "Group 2 Principal Distribution Amount: With respect to each Distribution Date, the product of (i) the Principal Distribution Amount and (ii) a fraction, the numerator of which is the Principal Remittance Amount for Loan Group 2 for that Distribution Date and the denominator of which is the aggregate Principal Remittance Amount for all of the Loan Groups for that Distribution Date."
