  "text": "Group 2 Senior Principal Distribution Amount: With respect to each Distribution Date, the product of (i) the Senior Principal Distribution Amount and (ii) a fraction, the numerator of which is the Principal Remittance Amount for Loan Group 2 for that Distribution Date and the denominator of which is the aggregate Principal Remittance Amount for all of the Loan Groups for that Distribution Date."
