{
  "id": "c274",
  "name": "1.01 Insurance Proceeds",
  "text": "Insurance Proceeds: Proceeds paid by an insurer pursuant to any title policy, hazard policy or other Insurance Policy covering a Mortgage Loan to the extent such proceeds are not to be applied to the restoration of the related Mortgaged Property or released to the Mortgagor in accordance with the procedures that the related Servicer would follow in servicing mortgage loans held for its own account, subject to the terms and conditions of the related Mortgage Note and Mortgage."
