  "text": "Master Servicer: Wells Fargo Bank, N.A., a national banking association, and its successors and assigns, in its capacity as Master Servicer hereunder, or any successor Master Servicer hereunder."
},
{
  "id": "c297",
  "name": "1.01 Master Servicer Event of Termination",
