  "name": "1.01 Mezzanine Cap Account",
  "text": "Mezzanine Cap Account: A segregated trust account established and maintained by the Trust Administrator pursuant to 3.07(j) of this agreement in which payments received from the Mezzanine Cap Provider will be deposited."
},
{
