  "name": "1.01 Mezzanine Cap Contract",
  "text": "Mezzanine Cap Contract: The cap contract between the Mezzanine Cap Provider and the Supplemental Interest Trust Trustee relating to the Certificates in the form attached hereto as Exhibit P."
},
{
  "id": "c303",
  "name": "1.01 Mezzanine Cap Contract Termination Date",
  "text": "Mezzanine Cap Contract Termination Date: The Distribution Date in February 2015."
},
{
  "id": "c304",
  "name": "1.01 Mezzanine Cap Provider",
  "text": "Mezzanine Cap Provider: Swiss Re Financial Products Corporation"
},
{
  "id": "c305",
  "name": "1.01 Mezzanine Certificates",
  "text": "Mezzanine Certificates: As defined in the Preliminary Statement."
},
{
  "id": "c306",
  "name": "1.01 Mezzanine Principal Distribution Amount",
  "text": "Mezzanine Principal Distribution Amount: For any Class of Mezzanine Certificates and Distribution Date, the excess of: (a) the sum of: (i) the aggregate Class Principal Balance of the Senior Certificates, other than the Interest Only Certificates (after taking into account the distribution of the Senior Principal Distribution Amount for such Distribution Date), (ii) the aggregate Class Principal Balance of any Class(es) of Mezzanine Certificates that are senior to the subject Class (in each case, after taking into account the distribution of the applicable Mezzanine Principal Distribution Amount(s) for such more senior Class(es) of Certificates for such Distribution Date), and (iii) the Class Principal Balance of such Class of Mezzanine Certificates immediately prior to such Distribution Date, over (b) the lesser of (a) the product of (x) 100% minus the applicable Stepdown Target Subordination Percentage for the subject Class of Mezzanine Certificates for that Distribution Date and (y) the aggregate Stated Principal Balance of the Mortgage Loans as of the Due Date in the month of that Distribution Date (after giving effect to principal prepayments received in the related Prepayment Period) and (b) the aggregate Stated Principal Balance of the Mortgage Loans as of the Due Date in the month of that Distribution Date (after giving effect to principal prepayments received in the related Prepayment Period) minus the OC Floor; provided, however, that if the Class Principal Balance of each Class of Senior Certificates has been reduced to zero, and such Class of Mezzanine Certificates is the only Class of Mezzanine Certificates outstanding on such Distribution Date, that Class will be entitled to receive the entire remaining Principal Distribution Amount until its Class Principal Balance is reduced to zero."
},
{
  "id": "c307",
  "name": "1.01 Middle REMIC 1",
  "text": "Middle REMIC 1: As specified in the Preliminary Statement."
},
{
  "id": "c308",
  "name": "1.01 Middle REMIC 1 Regular Interest",
  "text": "Middle REMIC 1 Regular Interest: As specified in the Preliminary Statement."
},
{
  "id": "c309",
